stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> ManagerApproval: Submit request
    ManagerApproval --> DataOwnerApproval: Manager approves
    DataOwnerApproval --> Provisioning: Data owner approves
    Provisioning --> Provisioning: Provisioning fails / retry automatically
    Provisioning --> Provisioned: Access granted
    Provisioned --> [*]

    note right of DataOwnerApproval
        Security review occurs outside the application
        and does not affect routing.
    end note

    note right of Provisioning
        Rollback and identity-administrator actions
        occur outside the application.
    end note

    note right of Provisioned
        Sole completed workflow state
    end note
